 /// only while a session keeps receiving requests, so an ENDED session's
 /// blobs would age forever. Hosts get the sweep on the store's first
 /// write (the store is built lazily at the first request — session open):
 /// every sibling `requests/` dir under `.fah/trajectories/` gets the same
 /// TTL pass, deleting EVERY blob past [ttlDays] (no newest-kept grace —
